  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Sustainable Development Framework Fund for Pakistan III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNSDF for Pakistan supports investments that accelerate the SDGs and lead to transformative humanitarian and development changes. By investing in (historically) underfunded areas and innovative joint programmes, it strengthens national capacities, grows partnerships, improves data collection and analysis, and helps stakeholders to address bottlenecks that threaten to block the path to SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
